<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LEASING TO ISSUE COMMERCIAL PAPERS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LEASING TO ISSUE COMMERCIAL PAPERS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Leasing, the leasing arm of Estonia's leading commercial bank Hansa Bank, will issue 30 million kroons worth of commercial papers on May 22, Hansa Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Three-month commercial papers have a yield of 7.48 percent, Ulo Kallas, interest rate products manager with Hansa Bank, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
